-- Expand the shopping game to cooking, kitchen equipment and shopping actions.
-- Additive only: never change existing words/enabled flags, games or scores.
-- Category labels organize this seed; no client schema/API changes are needed.
-- All entries must be 4–6 letters. Do not silently filter spelling/length errors.
